OL,3,GNEWSAEV parking to be rolled out to
OL,4,Amore rural areas
OL,5,
OL,6,FA scheme aimed at stopping rural areas
OL,7,Fbeing left behind in the transition to
OL,8,Felectric vehicles (EVs) will bring more
OL,9,Fcharging points to towns and villages
OL,10,Facross Oxfordshire.
OL,12,FFunded by a #4m government grant, the
OL,13,Fcounty council programme hoped to
OL,14,Fprovide an extra 1,500 public EV
OL,15,Fchargers over the next two years.
OL,17,FBut at a council meeting on Thursday,
OL,18,Fsome of the proposed sites, including
OL,19,Fin Bampton, Shrivenham and Headington,
OL,20,Fhave been delayed over concerns that
OL,21,Fthe parking bays are needed by all
OL,22,Fmotorists,
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
